flowchart TD
    L[Load progress] --> C{Canonical payload exists?}
    C -->|No| G[Read legacy indexes/stars/coins]
    G --> U[Map highest/current to stable level IDs]
    U --> X[Discard coins and reset all old stars]
    X --> P[Persist canonical schema]
    P --> K[Remove legacy keys]
    C -->|Yes| S[Sanitize canonical payload]
    S --> V{Older levelSetVersion?}
    V -->|Yes| R[Preserve unlock/current; reset listed level stars once]
    R --> P2[Persist new levelSetVersion]
    V -->|No| O[Return sanitized progress]
    K --> O
    P2 --> O
